      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/La_Brea_Tar_Pits%2C_Los_Angeles%2C_California_%282%29_%283124932645%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:La_Brea_Tar_Pits,_Los_Angeles,_California_(2)_(3124932645).jpg",
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 960,
